","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":38,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"lizang-q-49bc1aa25f35e32ade60","section":"chapter-018","block":"b-f2c7a004344479739639","layer":"original","quote":"别遣铁骑二百，迎吏官属；东缘酒泉北塞，径出张掖北河，逢迎太守尹奉","section_title":"二李臧文吕许典二庞阎传第十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0041.xhtml","index":251,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":39,"end":71,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"lizang-q-6990f13f51360a8892b1","section":"chapter-018","block":"b-70898cfcffa39d291237","layer":"original","quote":"时酒泉黄华、张掖张进，各据其郡，欲与恭（艾）并势","section_title":"二李臧文吕许典二庞阎传第十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0041.xhtml","index":250,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":67,"end":91,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"lizang-q-bbbf7e14283ba5da8cab","section":"chapter-018","block":"b-f2c7a004344479739639","layer":"original","quote":"于是，张进须黄华之助〖16〗；华欲救进，西顾恭兵，恐急击其后，遂诣金城太守苏则降","section_title":"二李臧文吕许典二庞阎传第十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0041.xhtml","index":251,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":76,"end":116,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"rensu-q-131d2e9d4727bb8913d2","section":"chapter-016","block":"b-ff53aeeeca30c3bafe3a","layer":"original","quote":"则遂与诸军围张掖，破之；斩进及其支党，众皆降","section_title":"任苏杜郑仓传第十六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0037.xhtml","index":31,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":224,"end":246,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"rensu-q-672330646ed54726015e","section":"chapter-016","block":"b-f2a1f0d88b85b5a704a9","layer":"original","quote":"张掖张进执太守杜通","section_title":"任苏杜郑仓传第十六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0037.xhtml","index":30,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":9,"end":18,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"rensu-q-708104788f9f28e00771","section":"chapter-016","block":"b-f2a1f0d88b85b5a704a9","layer":"original","quote":"后演复结旁郡为乱","section_title":"任苏杜郑仓传第十六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0037.xhtml","index":30,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":8,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"rensu-q-87331ef88f5f111f3e7d","section":"chapter-016","block":"b-ff53aeeeca30c3bafe3a","layer":"original","quote":"演闻之，将步骑三千迎则；辞来助军〖8〗，而实欲为变。则诱与相见，因斩之；出以徇军〖9〗，其党皆散走","section_title":"任苏杜郑仓传第十六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0037.xhtml","index":31,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":174,"end":223,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"rensu-q-8866e3b3b3c5ef093f51","section":"chapter-016","block":"b-ff53aeeeca30c3bafe3a","layer":"original","quote":"于是昭等从之，乃发兵救武威；降其三种胡","section_title":"任苏杜郑仓传第十六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0037.xhtml","index":31,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":146,"end":165,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"rensu-q-89f8773457ad9ed676b9","section":"chapter-016","block":"b-ff53aeeeca30c3bafe3a","layer":"original","quote":"河西平，乃还金城","section_title":"任苏杜郑仓传第十六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0037.xhtml","index":31,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":264,"end":272,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"rensu-q-8d497aa5e12452521112","section":"chapter-016","block":"b-ff53aeeeca30c3bafe3a","layer":"original","quote":"则乃见郡中大吏及昭等〖3〗，与羌豪帅谋曰：“今贼虽盛，然皆新合；或有胁从，未必同心。因衅击之〖4〗，善恶必离；离而归我，我增而彼损矣。既获益众之实，且有倍气之势〖5〗；率以进讨，破之必矣。若待大军，旷日持久；善人无归，必合于恶；善恶既合，势难猝离。虽有诏命〖6〗，违而合权，专之可也","section_title":"任苏杜郑仓传第十六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0037.xhtml","index":31,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":141,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"rensu-q-9ebd4335c7d1500f1afd","section":"chapter-016","block":"b-ff53aeeeca30c3bafe3a","layer":"original","quote":"演军败，华惧，出所执乞降","section_title":"任苏杜郑仓传第十六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0037.xhtml","index":31,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":247,"end":259,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"rensu-q-d8ad3784f12f64f762ae","section":"chapter-016","block":"b-f2a1f0d88b85b5a704a9","layer":"original","quote":"酒泉黄华不受太守辛机〖1〗；进、华皆自称太守，以应之","section_title":"任苏杜郑仓传第十六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0037.xhtml","index":30,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":19,"end":45,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"rensu-q-e78f512255bb183010b0","section":"chapter-016","block":"b-f2a1f0d88b85b5a704a9","layer":"original","quote":"武威太守毌丘兴，告急于则","section_title":"任苏杜郑仓传第十六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0037.xhtml","index":30,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":62,"end":74,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"rensu-q-f9e1009ed308649c45ca","section":"chapter-016","block":"b-ff53aeeeca30c3bafe3a","layer":"original","quote":"与兴击进于张掖","section_title":"任苏杜郑仓传第十六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0037.xhtml","index":31,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":166,"end":173,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wendi-e-o007d-q","section":"chapter-002","block":"b-aff500edc4a38bf656c0","layer":"original","quote":"酒泉黄华、张掖张进等各执太守以叛〖9〗。金城太守苏则讨进，斩之〖10〗。华降。","section_title":"文帝纪第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0009.xhtml","index":40,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":83,"end":122,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wendi-q-b-ec88012a7f6c352d0e04","section":"chapter-002","block":"b-ec88012a7f6c352d0e04","layer":"modern","quote":"〖1〗二年：黄初二年（公元 221）。","section_title":"文帝纪第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0009.xhtml","index":210,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-8fff547b113ffa36bbc1","start":0,"end":19,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wendi-q-o002","section":"chapter-002","block":"b-1c3ea4f0ea338bf2ec5a","layer":"original","quote":"太祖崩，嗣位为丞相，魏王。﹝三﹞尊王后曰王太后〖5〗。改建安二十五年为延康元年。","section_title":"文帝纪第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0009.xhtml","index":2,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":40,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wendi-q-o019","section":"chapter-002","block":"b-8820e5c7f9006d364c44","layer":"original","quote":"二年春正月〖1〗，郊祀天地、明堂〖2〗。甲戌〖3〗，校猎至原陵〖4〗。遣使者，以太牢祠汉世祖〖5〗。乙亥〖6〗，朝日于东郊〖7〗。﹝一﹞初令郡国口满十万者〖8〗，岁察孝廉一人；其有秀异〖9〗，无拘户口。辛巳〖10〗，分三公户邑，封子弟各一人为列侯。壬午〖11〗，复颍川郡一年田租〖12〗。﹝二﹞改许县为许昌县。以魏郡东部为阳平郡〖13〗，西部为广平郡〖14〗。﹝三﹞","section_title":"文帝纪第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0009.xhtml","index":208,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":183,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wgc-q0011","section":"chapter-028","block":"b-9d2fd98fa3c9420e521b","layer":"original","quote":"毌丘俭字仲恭〖1〗，河东闻喜人也。父兴，黄初中为武威太守；伐叛柔服〖2〗，开通河右，名次金城太守苏则〖3〗。讨贼张进及讨叛胡有功，封高阳乡侯。﹝一﹞入为将作大匠。","section_title":"王毌丘诸葛邓钟传第二十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0062.xhtml","index":60,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":81,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wgc-q0096","section":"chapter-028","block":"b-838f6fbe760c50242c1a","layer":"pei","quote":"﹝一﹞《魏名臣奏》载雍州刺史张既表曰：“河右遐远，丧乱弥久；武威当诸郡路道喉辖之要，加民、夷杂处，数有兵难。（领）〔顷〕太守毌丘兴，到官，内抚吏民，外怀羌胡；卒使柔附，为官效用。黄华、张进，初图逆乱，扇动左右；兴志气忠烈，临难不顾，为将校、民、夷陈说祸福，言则涕泣。于时男女万口，咸怀感激，形毁发乱，誓心致命。寻率精兵，踧胁张掖，济拔领太守杜通、西海太守张睦。张掖番和、骊靬二县吏民及郡杂胡，弃恶诣兴，兴皆安恤，使尽力田。兴每所历，尽竭心力，诚国之良吏。殿下即位，留心万机；苟有毫毛之善，必有赏录。臣伏缘圣旨，指陈其事。”","attribution":"魏名臣奏所载张既表","section_title":"王毌丘诸葛邓钟传第二十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0062.xhtml","index":82,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-077b1f419279b4f4bc30","start":0,"end":261,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wgc-q0184","section":"chapter-028","block":"b-9d2fd98fa3c9420e521b","layer":"original","quote":"父兴，黄初中为武威太守","section_title":"王毌丘诸葛邓钟传第二十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0062.xhtml","index":60,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":17,"end":28,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wgc-q0185","section":"chapter-028","block":"b-9d2fd98fa3c9420e521b","layer":"original","quote":"伐叛柔服〖2〗，开通河右","section_title":"王毌丘诸葛邓钟传第二十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0062.xhtml","index":60,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":29,"end":41,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wgc-q0186","section":"chapter-028","block":"b-9d2fd98fa3c9420e521b","layer":"original","quote":"讨贼张进及讨叛胡有功","section_title":"王毌丘诸葛邓钟传第二十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0062.xhtml","index":60,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":54,"end":64,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wgc-q0187","section":"chapter-028","block":"b-9d2fd98fa3c9420e521b","layer":"original","quote":"封高阳乡侯","section_title":"王毌丘诸葛邓钟传第二十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0062.xhtml","index":60,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":65,"end":70,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wgc-q0188","section":"chapter-028","block":"b-9d2fd98fa3c9420e521b","layer":"original","quote":"入为将作大匠","section_title":"王毌丘诸葛邓钟传第二十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0062.xhtml","index":60,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":74,"end":80,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wgc-q0553","section":"chapter-028","block":"b-838f6fbe760c50242c1a","layer":"pei","quote":"太守毌丘兴，到官，内抚吏民，外怀羌胡；卒使柔附，为官效用","attribution":"裴注·魏名臣奏","section_title":"王毌丘诸葛邓钟传第二十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0062.xhtml","index":82,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-077b1f419279b4f4bc30","start":60,"end":88,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wgc-q0554","section":"chapter-028","block":"b-838f6fbe760c50242c1a","layer":"pei","quote":"黄华、张进，初图逆乱，扇动左右；兴志气忠烈，临难不顾，为将校、民、夷陈说祸福，言则涕泣。于时男女万口，咸怀感激，形毁发乱，誓心致命","attribution":"裴注·魏名臣奏","section_title":"王毌丘诸葛邓钟传第二十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0062.xhtml","index":82,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-077b1f419279b4f4bc30","start":89,"end":154,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wgc-q0555","section":"chapter-028","block":"b-838f6fbe760c50242c1a","layer":"pei","quote":"寻率精兵，踧胁张掖，济拔领太守杜通、西海太守张睦","attribution":"裴注·魏名臣奏","section_title":"王毌丘诸葛邓钟传第二十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0062.xhtml","index":82,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-077b1f419279b4f4bc30","start":155,"end":179,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wgc-q0556","section":"chapter-028","block":"b-838f6fbe760c50242c1a","layer":"pei","quote":"张掖番和、骊靬二县吏民及郡杂胡，弃恶诣兴，兴皆安恤，使尽力田","attribution":"裴注·魏名臣奏","section_title":"王毌丘诸葛邓钟传第二十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0062.xhtml","index":82,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-077b1f419279b4f4bc30","start":180,"end":210,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wudi-e-o163a-q","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-b603bc67965be4873eff","layer":"original","quote":"安定太守毌丘兴将之官〖5〗，公戒之曰：“羌胡欲与中国通，自当遣人来，慎勿遣人往！善人难得，必将教羌胡妄有所请求，因欲以自利。不从，便为失异俗意〖6〗；从之，则无益事。”兴至，遣校尉范陵至羌中；陵果教羌，使自请为属国都尉〖7〗。公曰：“吾预知当尔。非圣也〖8〗，但更事多耳。”﹝一﹞","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_001.xhtml","index":282,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":140,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wudi-q-b-c4192d9fada3bef44302","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-c4192d9fada3bef44302","layer":"modern","quote":"〖1〗十九年：建安十九年（公元 214）。","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_001.xhtml","index":293,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-e80ed93e01a75d2ad2bd","start":0,"end":21,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wudi-q-o161","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-ba55911420464ee82a49","layer":"original","quote":"十九年春正月〖1〗，始耕籍田〖2〗。","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_001.xhtml","index":280,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":18,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wudi-q-o163","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-b603bc67965be4873eff","layer":"original","quote":"安定太守毌丘兴将之官〖5〗，公戒之曰：“羌胡欲与中国通，自当遣人来，慎勿遣人往！善人难得，必将教羌胡妄有所请求，因欲以自利。不从，便为失异俗意〖6〗；从之，则无益事。”兴至，遣校尉范陵至羌中；陵果教羌，使自请为属国都尉〖7〗。公曰：“吾预知当尔。非圣也〖8〗，但更事多耳。”﹝一﹞","